WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:07.976
Welcome to WODDI Institute. This short guide shows you how to use the app, step by step.

2
00:00:07.976 --> 00:00:16.430
WODDI Institute is free learning for women across Africa: practical skills, mentors and certificates, all on your phone.

3
00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:24.675
First, choose your language. Tap it at the top of the page. The app changes to your language.

4
00:00:25.225 --> 00:00:28.030
To join, tap Get started.

5
00:00:28.030 --> 00:00:30.330
Type your full name.

6
00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:36.231
You can sign up with your email or your phone number. Here, we use a phone number.

7
00:00:36.231 --> 00:00:39.595
Choose your country, then choose your network.

8
00:00:39.595 --> 00:00:45.228
Make a password with at least six letters or numbers, then tap Create account.

9
00:00:45.228 --> 00:00:50.225
Your account is ready. Tap the button to open your dashboard.

10
00:00:50.775 --> 00:00:53.480
Next time, tap Sign in.

11
00:00:53.480 --> 00:01:00.427
Enter the same phone number or email, and your password. You can also tap Continue with Google.

12
00:01:00.427 --> 00:01:05.437
If you forget your password, tap Forgot password, and we will help you.

13
00:01:05.987 --> 00:01:11.194
This is your home screen. The big card always shows your next step.

14
00:01:11.194 --> 00:01:18.699
The menu at the bottom takes you everywhere: home, learning, community, your mentor, your profile and more.

15
00:01:19.249 --> 00:01:26.500
Everyone starts with Rooting: eight short modules about WODDI and your journey. Tap Start Rooting.

16
00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:28.504
Open the first module.

17
00:01:28.504 --> 00:01:30.630
Read the lesson to the end.

18
00:01:30.630 --> 00:01:39.410
Answer the quick question, then tap Submit and mark complete. The next module opens. Finish all eight.

19
00:01:39.960 --> 00:01:45.630
When Rooting is done, Blueprint opens. Tap the Blueprint card.

20
00:01:45.630 --> 00:01:54.957
Blueprint has three pillars: Identity, Mandate, and Influence and Legacy. Complete them in order, the same way.

21
00:01:55.507 --> 00:02:02.706
After Blueprint, the Course Hub opens, with more than one hundred courses. Tap Learn.

22
00:02:02.706 --> 00:02:06.581
Tap Browse courses, and choose a course you like.

23
00:02:06.581 --> 00:02:11.271
The course page shows what you will learn. Tap Start course.

24
00:02:11.271 --> 00:02:15.836
Read each lesson, or tap the headphones button to listen to it.

25
00:02:15.836 --> 00:02:23.350
Tap Continue to move on. Each module ends with a short quiz, and the course ends with a final quiz.

26
00:02:23.900 --> 00:02:30.192
When you pass the final quiz, you earn a certificate. To see it, tap More.

27
00:02:30.192 --> 00:02:31.941
Then tap Certs.

28
00:02:31.941 --> 00:02:34.037
Tap View and download.

29
00:02:34.037 --> 00:02:42.218
Tap Download PDF, or Download PNG for a picture. Anyone can check your certificate online with its code.

30
00:02:42.768 --> 00:02:50.028
Your certificate also opens your graduate space. On your home screen, tap Alumni Community.

31
00:02:50.028 --> 00:02:59.928
Share a win, ask a question or offer help. Write your message and tap Post.

32
00:02:59.928 --> 00:03:06.139
Here you can also join circles, meet other graduates, and find opportunities and events.

33
00:03:06.689 --> 00:03:10.675
To sell a product or a skill, tap My Marketplace shop.

34
00:03:10.675 --> 00:03:15.498
Tap New listing, then choose product, service or skill.

35
00:03:15.498 --> 00:03:21.189
Give it a clear name and choose a category.

36
00:03:21.189 --> 00:03:32.780
Describe it and set your price.

37
00:03:32.780 --> 00:03:38.701
Add your WhatsApp number and tap Publish listing. Buyers contact you directly.

38
00:03:39.251 --> 00:03:43.090
Need help at any time? Tap Mentor.

39
00:03:43.090 --> 00:03:51.277
Type your question and tap send. Your mentor answers in your language.

40
00:03:51.277 --> 00:03:54.196
You can also tap the microphone and speak.

41
00:03:54.196 --> 00:03:57.415
To start a fresh chat, tap Clear chat.

42
00:03:57.965 --> 00:04:02.416
To change how the app works, tap More, then Settings.

43
00:04:02.416 --> 00:04:05.196
Here you can turn dark mode on or off,

44
00:04:05.196 --> 00:04:07.026
make the text bigger,

45
00:04:07.026 --> 00:04:12.475
change the app language, and turn on phone alerts, so you never miss a message.

46
00:04:12.475 --> 00:04:14.622
Sign out is at the bottom.

47
00:04:15.172 --> 00:04:19.487
To watch this guide again, tap More, then How to use.

48
00:04:19.487 --> 00:04:26.140
You are ready. Welcome to WODDI Institute. No woman is left out.

